#. box title
#: site/lectures/07-text-processing.md:934
msgid "`08/06/2014` - June or August?"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-processing.md:935
msgid "In Bulgaria and most of Europe it is the 8th of June; in the USA it is the 6th of August. Python does not guess: you choose `%d/%m` or `%m/%d`. As with numbers: know the source."
msgstr ""

