#: site/lectures/07-text-processing.md:1180
msgid "**Exercise**"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-processing.md:1182
msgid "Add the rule \"`ия` at the end of a word -> `ia`\" to the transliteration: first replace it, then `translate`. Check it with `София` and `Мария`."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-processing.md:1197
msgid "(The ASCII letters `ia` pass through `translate` unchanged.)"
msgstr ""

